  "body": "## What changed\n- `ground_grid_lines` in `crates/ui/src/interact.rs` no longer reads `show_world_axes`. The grid follows `show_grid` alone. The axes follow `show_world_axes` alone.\n- The hover texts of the Display menu boxes \"Grid\" and \"Origin axes\" no longer say that one needs the other.\n- The doc comments in `interact.rs` and `state.rs` (`show_grid`) say the same.\n- The Browser box and the viewport nav button only write `show_world_axes`, so they need no change.\n\n## Readings\n- `show_world_axes` is not saved in the view file. Only `show_grid` is saved. The saved view preferences do not change.\n\n## Pinning tests\n- `the_ground_grid_is_a_round_spaced_floor` (`crates/ui/src/law_tests.rs`): axes off leaves the grid. Grid off hides it. Axes on does not bring it back.\n- `the_graphics_entries_set_their_fields` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/display_menu.rs`): the Origin axes box off leaves `show_grid` on and the grid lines are still produced.\n- Both pass with `cargo xtask gate test <name> --crate camcraft-ui --exact`.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib`: 1425 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base origin/main` (plan: only `camcraft-ui` steps): 19 steps, 0 failed.\n\n## Not exercised\n- No clippy run.\n- No heavy lane, no pixel snapshot. No snapshot PNG changed.\n- No test for the Browser box \"Show world origin axes\" or the viewport nav button against the grid. Both write the same field as the Display menu box.\n- The app was not started.\n\n## Screenshots\nThe window is 1280x800. The model is `testdata/models/fig8.step`. The camera is the same in both pictures. The Display menu has \"Grid\" on and \"Origin axes\" off.\nBefore is `main` at `174584111`. After is this PR head `7d3077d52`. The images are on the images-only `screenshots` branch (commit `a789dd789`). No image is on this PR branch.\n\nBefore: the ground grid is gone together with the axes.\n\n![Before: grid and axes hidden](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a789dd789328d4b4966668cf2317aa9bceb46289/pr-3342/grid-axes-off-before.png)\n\nAfter: the ground grid stays. The axes are hidden.\n\n![After: grid shown, axes hidden](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a789dd789328d4b4966668cf2317aa9bceb46289/pr-3342/grid-axes-off-after.png)\n\nAfter: the Display menu state for the picture above.\n\n![After: Display menu, Grid on, Origin axes off](https://raw.githubusercontent.com/NeoTech/Camcraft/a789dd789328d4b4966668cf2317aa9bceb46289/pr-3342/display-menu-after.png)\n\nChangelog: Hiding the world origin axes no longer hides the ground grid. The Grid box hides the grid alone. The Origin axes box hides the axes alone.\nEffort: low\n\nFixes #3322\n\n",
